(
    title: "Mines of Minos",
    description: Some("The last working robot in a mine overrun by aliens, scavenging its fellows\' parts: carry a piece to the centre of a level\'s top or bottom row and it becomes a spare life. Time bombs are the only weapon. Linger and water rises from the top of the level, slowing you and stopping you bombing at all — and a second player can take the part of an alien."),
